  - W=1 compile clean per patch.
  - sparse (master branch, post 0.6.4): no findings in
    net/core/flow_dissector.c. The nixpkgs 0.6.4 cannot parse
    recent kernel headers; build instructions for sparse-master
    at https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/devel/sparse/sparse.git
  - smatch (Dan Carpenter, version 1.74): no findings in
    net/core/flow_dissector.c.
  - coccicheck (kernel semantic patcher) on net/core/: no
    new findings introduced by this series.
