  - 16 macro cells (iperf3 + iperf2 x IPv4/IPv6 x TCP/UDP x
    two pairs). No regression vs the B.1 24 h soak baseline on
    mlx5; first ever measurement on i40e at near link rate.


Pre-post checklist still TODO before non-RFC posting
====================================================

  - 24h iperf3 soak and 24h iperf2 soak. Same pattern as the
    series 1 soak result for sch_cake. Queued for the i40e and
    mlx5 pairs in parallel.
  - 30-min sustained per pair (catches drift not visible in
